      "history": ""
    },
    "biography": "<table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Concept</th><td>FIRSTLIGHT tactical team drone operator, former Air Force drone pilot</td></tr><tr><th>Age</th><td>31</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>Get FIRSTLIGHT to give him a fleet of his own.</td></tr><tr><th>Desire</th><td>For Okafor to say his name over the radio, not his call sign.</td></tr><tr><th>Dice pools</th><td>Physical 6 · Social 2 · Mental 4 · Firearms 7 · Athletics 5 · Awareness 5 · Brawl 5</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Thirty-one, skinny, backward cap, a ruggedized tablet strapped to his forearm. Talks to the drone like it&#39;s a dog.</p><p>One of the six operators of @UUID[Actor.abaWg7NwNQvM0sDc]{FIRSTLIGHT Tactical Team}. Spends more hours in the van than in the port warehouse.</p><h3>Hunter</h3><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Cell</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.dnsWkdXVJ19riBLa.JournalEntryPage.O8yPSIYLlTrKHm8G]{Puget Cell}</td></tr><tr><th>Creed</th><td>Underground. <em>Desperation:</em> Stealth and subterfuge in service of the Hunt.</td></tr><tr><th>Drive</th><td>Pride. <em>Redemption:</em> He finds redemption when his work, and nobody else&#39;s, saves a Cell operation, and Okafor says so over the radio.</td></tr><tr><th>Edges</th><td>Drone Jockey (Flying Low)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>He was top of his class at Creech, and nobody ever said it out loud. Nobody in FIRSTLIGHT on the West Coast flies like he does. He knows it, and he needs them to know it.</p><p>@UUID[JournalEntry.LfywH6qtS3GxDxJx.JournalEntryPage.XU2P6dmdMiaqAjHj]{Pregen: Owen Pak · Drone Pilot}</p>",
    "appearance": "<p>Thirty-one, skinny, backward cap, a ruggedized tablet strapped to his forearm. Talks to the drone like it&#39;s a dog.</p>",
    "equipment": "",
    "notes": "",
    "privatenotes": "<h3>Proposed (not in the docs)</h3><ul><li>The whole character is proposed. Conversion of the @UUID[Actor.abaWg7NwNQvM0sDc]{FIRSTLIGHT Tactical Team} pools (Physical 6, Social 2, Mental 4; Firearms 7, Athletics 5, Awareness 5, Brawl 5; Health 7, Willpower 5) to Attributes and Skills: Dexterity 3 + Firearms 4, Dexterity 3 + Athletics 2, Strength 3 + Brawl 2, Wits 3 + Awareness 2; Health = Stamina 4 + 3; Willpower = Composure 3 + Resolve 2. Technology (Drones), Drive, Stealth, and Investigation are his own.</li><li>Underground Creed, Pride Drive, Drone Jockey Edge with the “Flying Low” Perk. The drone is the one from the doc 14 arsenal.</li></ul>",
